---
/**
 * NagornayaIndexMain — balanced native <main> for /nagornaya//.
 *
 * V8/V9 hardening: avoid unbalanced tags across Astro component boundaries.
 * The markup is first-class Astro HTML (no raw imports), extracted from the
 * approved legacy main so Playwright/pixelmatch can verify exact parity.
 */
---
<main id="main-content" class="lg:pl-64" data-pagefind-body>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 pt-20 lg:pt-8 space-y-6">

      <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
      <nav class="text-xs flex items-center flex-wrap gap-0.5 mb-2"><a href="../articles/" class="text-stone-500 hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">Статьи</a><span class="text-stone-400 mx-1.5">/</span><span class="text-stone-700 font-medium">Нагорная проповедь</span></nav>

      <!-- Hero -->
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-800 to-stone-900 text-white p-8 md:p-12">
        <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 text-stone-700 text-[180px] font-serif select-none opacity-20 leading-none">✝</div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="bg-amber-600/30 border border-amber-500/40 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold">Авторская серия</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-3 leading-tight">Нагорная проповедь</h1>
          <p class="text-stone-300 text-lg mb-1">Сравнительное исследование Матфея 5–7 и Луки 6:17–49</p>
          <p class="text-stone-400 text-sm max-w-xl mb-6">Пять связанных исследований о Матфея 5–7 и Луки 6:17–49: содержание, методология записи, адресат, богодухновенность и практическое применение. TMS · Chou · MacArthur · Chicago Statement · TMSJ</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <div class="bg-stone-700/60 border border-stone-600 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-center" style="min-width:72px;"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400">5</div><div class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-tight">частей серии</div></div>
            <div class="bg-stone-700/60 border border-stone-600 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-center" style="min-width:72px;"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400">120+</div><div class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-tight">источников</div></div>
            <div class="bg-stone-700/60 border border-stone-600 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-center" style="min-width:72px;"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400">21</div><div class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-tight">находка</div></div>
            <div class="bg-stone-700/60 border border-stone-600 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-center" style="min-width:72px;"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400">107</div><div class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-tight">стихов Мф</div></div>
            <div class="bg-stone-700/60 border border-stone-600 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-center" style="min-width:72px;"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400">30</div><div class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-tight">стихов Лк</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Key quotes -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wide">Тематический центр</div>
          <blockquote class="text-stone-800 font-medium text-sm leading-relaxed">«Если праведность ваша не превзойдёт праведности книжников и фарисеев, то вы не войдёте в Царство Небесное»</blockquote>
          <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-stone-500">Мф 5:20 — ключ ко всей проповеди (MacArthur GTY #2222, 1979)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-stone-600 mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wide">Итоговая формула</div>
          <blockquote class="text-stone-800 font-medium text-sm leading-relaxed">«Нагорная проповедь не является путём оправдания делами, законом Тысячелетия или недостижимым идеалом. Она — богодухновенное учение Царя о жизни тех, кто принадлежит Его Царству»</blockquote>
          <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-stone-500">Серия целиком · Ред.: Фёдор Милованов</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Parts grid -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-800 mb-4">Пять частей серии</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          
          <a href="/nagornaya/chast-1/" class="group text-left rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 block">
            <div class="p-5 text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,58,138,0.92) 0%, rgba(23,37,84,0.98) 100%);">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/></svg></span>
                <span class="text-5xl font-black opacity-15 leading-none">I</span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-bold text-base leading-tight mb-0.5">Два текста, один Иисус</div>
              <div class="text-xs opacity-75">Содержание Мф 5–7 и Лк 6:17–49</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 border border-stone-100 border-t-0 group-hover:border-blue-100 group-hover:shadow-md transition-colors">
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">Архитектура проповеди, inclusio, антитезы, блаженства, «горе вам», два строителя. Почему нельзя читать только параллельные места.</p>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 group-hover:text-amber-700">Читать →</div>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/nagornaya/chast-2/" class="group text-left rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 block">
            <div class="p-5 text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6,78,59,0.92) 0%, rgba(2,44,34,0.98) 100%);">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg></span>
                <span class="text-5xl font-black opacity-15 leading-none">II</span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-bold text-base leading-tight mb-0.5">Как это записывалось</div>
              <div class="text-xs opacity-75">Синоптическая проблема и богодухновенность</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 border border-stone-100 border-t-0 group-hover:border-emerald-100 group-hover:shadow-md transition-colors">
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">Q-гипотеза, Independence View, ipsissima vox/verba, Chicago Statement, спектр консервативных позиций.</p>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 group-hover:text-amber-700">Читать →</div>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/nagornaya/chast-3/" class="group text-left rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 block">
            <div class="p-5 text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(88,28,135,0.92) 0%, rgba(46,16,101,0.98) 100%);">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></span>
                <span class="text-5xl font-black opacity-15 leading-none">III</span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-bold text-base leading-tight mb-0.5">Кому это сказано?</div>
              <div class="text-xs opacity-75">Адресат и диапазон позиций</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 border border-stone-100 border-t-0 group-hover:border-purple-100 group-hover:shadow-md transition-colors">
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">Четыре уровня, пять позиций, Мф 5:20 как ключ, Мф 28:20 как аргумент, апостольские параллели.</p>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 group-hover:text-amber-700">Читать →</div>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/nagornaya/chast-4/" class="group text-left rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 block">
            <div class="p-5 text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(120,53,15,0.92) 0%, rgba(78,30,0,0.98) 100%);">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 2h2v20h-2z"/><path d="M5 9h14v2H5z"/></svg></span>
                <span class="text-5xl font-black opacity-15 leading-none">IV</span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-bold text-base leading-tight mb-0.5">Богодухновенность</div>
              <div class="text-xs opacity-75">Различия и доверие к Евангелиям</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 border border-stone-100 border-t-0 group-hover:border-amber-100 group-hover:shadow-md transition-colors">
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">Theopneustos, concursus (Warfield), Chicago Statement, Ин 14:26, современные опасности, тесты.</p>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 group-hover:text-amber-700">Читать →</div>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/nagornaya/chast-5/" class="group text-left rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 block">
            <div class="p-5 text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(136,19,55,0.92) 0%, rgba(76,5,25,0.98) 100%);">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 0 1.275 1.275L21 12l-5.812 1.912a2 2 0 0 0-1.275 1.275L12 21l-1.912-5.812a2 2 0 0 0-1.275-1.275L3 12l5.812-1.912a2 2 0 0 0 1.275-1.275z"/></svg></span>
                <span class="text-5xl font-black opacity-15 leading-none">V</span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-bold text-base leading-tight mb-0.5">Закон, Евангелие, Нагорная проповедь</div>
              <div class="text-xs opacity-75">спасение с признанием Господства и три usus Закона</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 border border-stone-100 border-t-0 group-hover:border-rose-100 group-hover:shadow-md transition-colors">
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">Блаженства как портрет спасённого, три использования Закона, пасторский баланс, зеркало / карта / дар.</p>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 group-hover:text-amber-700">Читать →</div>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/nagornaya/istochniki/" class="group text-left rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 block">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 to-indigo-800 p-5 text-white">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="5" x="2" y="3" rx="1"/><path d="M4 8v11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8"/><path d="M10 12h4"/></svg></span>
                <span class="text-5xl font-black opacity-15 leading-none">≡</span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-bold text-base leading-tight mb-0.5">Источники серии</div>
              <div class="text-xs opacity-75">120+ источников</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 border border-stone-100 border-t-0 group-hover:border-blue-100 group-hover:shadow-md transition-colors">
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">Полная библиография: TMSJ, книги, GTY проповеди, исповедания, Чикагское заявление.</p>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 group-hover:text-amber-700">Открыть →</div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Key verified sources -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span>🔑</span> Ключевые источники серии</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs"><div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 rounded-lg p-2.5"><div class="font-semibold text-stone-800 text-xs">MacArthur GTY #2222 (5 Aug 1979)</div><div class="text-stone-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Мф 5:20 как ключ; антитезы восстанавливают стандарт</div></div><div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 rounded-lg p-2.5"><div class="font-semibold text-stone-800 text-xs">Warfield, The Inspiration and Authority (P&R, 1948)</div><div class="text-stone-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Theopneustos = «выдохнуто Богом»; concursus</div></div><div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 rounded-lg p-2.5"><div class="font-semibold text-stone-800 text-xs">Chicago Statement on Biblical Inerrancy (1978), Art. XIII</div><div class="text-stone-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Различный отбор материала в параллельных текстах совместим с непогрешимостью</div></div><div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 rounded-lg p-2.5"><div class="font-semibold text-stone-800 text-xs">Calvin, Commentary Matthew 5:1 (CCEL/BibleHub)</div><div class="text-stone-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Прямо отвергает идею двух разных проповедей</div></div><div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 rounded-lg p-2.5"><div class="font-semibold text-stone-800 text-xs">Spurgeon, The Beatitudes (1873, SpurgeonGems)</div><div class="text-stone-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Блаженства = кто спасён, не как спастись</div></div><div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 rounded-lg p-2.5"><div class="font-semibold text-stone-800 text-xs">Feinberg, Inerrancy (Zondervan, 1980), p. 301</div><div class="text-stone-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Ipsissima vox — атрибуция термина, не MacArthur/Drawing Near</div></div><div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 rounded-lg p-2.5"><div class="font-semibold text-stone-800 text-xs">Turner, JETS 53/4 (2010)</div><div class="text-stone-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Scofield допускал «нравственное применение» — нельзя карикатурировать</div></div><div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100 rounded-lg p-2.5"><div class="font-semibold text-stone-800 text-xs">Ligonier Study Guide (learn.ligonier.org)</div><div class="text-stone-500 text-xs mt-0.5">«полностью точное резюме под вдохновением Святого Духа»</div></div></div>
      </div>
    
    </div>
  <aside class="gb-accuracy-block" aria-label="Обратная связь">
  <div class="gb-accuracy-inner">
    <h2 class="gb-accuracy-title">Нашли неточность?</h2>
    <p class="gb-accuracy-desc">
      Богословскую или техническую — напишите, исправим.
    </p>
    <div class="gb-accuracy-actions" role="list">
      <a href="mailto:viktorcoy2012@gmail.com?subject=Неточность%20в%20статье&body=Здравствуйте%2C%0A%0AЯ%20нашёл%20неточность%20в%20материале.%0A%0AОписание%3A%20"
         class="gb-accuracy-btn gb-accuracy-btn--email"
         role="listitem"
         aria-label="Написать на Email">
        <svg class="gb-accuracy-btn__icon"
             width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
             fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
             stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
             aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="3"/>
          <path d="m2 7 10 7 10-7"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="gb-accuracy-btn__label">Email</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://t.me/fedormilovanov"
         class="gb-accuracy-btn gb-accuracy-btn--tg"
         role="listitem"
         target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         aria-label="Написать в Telegram (откроется в новой вкладке)">
        <svg class="gb-accuracy-btn__icon"
             width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
             fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
             stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
             aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path d="M21.5 2.5 2.5 10l7.5 2 2 7.5 9.5-17Z"/>
          <path d="m10 12 10-9.5"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="gb-accuracy-btn__label">Telegram</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside><div class="article-end-block article-end-sdg-wrap"><div class="article-end-sdg" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><meta itemprop="about" content="Soli Deo Gloria"><span class="sdg" itemprop="name">Soli Deo Gloria</span><svg width="52" height="70" viewBox="0 0 52 70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="26" y1="3" x2="26" y2="67" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="6" y1="19" x2="46" y2="19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"></line></svg></div></div>
</main>
